local-overlay*.md
dist/
.DS_Store
# Per-arch binaries are never tracked: dist/ holds the release builds and
# skills/outsource/bin/outsource-<os>-<arch> is a local build for this
# machine (the dispatcher fetches or builds one elsewhere). The dash in the
# pattern is why bin/outsource.sha256 — a dot — stays committable.
skills/outsource/bin/outsource-*
